        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn WLHBP, Black Iron Warwick Privacy Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Warwick Turnpike and Privacy Bolt is typically used on bedroom or bathroom doors as a way to add a privacy lock to interior doors. It features a Warwick rose made from rough black iron for an old world looks. The Black Iron Warwick Privacy Bolt comes packaged with a thumb-turn, a strike, and a latch. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Acorn WLHBP Privacy Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Spindle and tail pieces: 1-1/2\" long with 3/16\" diamond diameter.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Will not cover a 2-1/8\" pre-drilled door borehole.</i>\r\n</p>",
